{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_1000_p", "source_sha256": "43f2b8bc57d25c63c0d1a93ae38425b53bab7826b37b37315233ee6cdac3653f", "ja": "（洋服をプロデュースする企画で、杏奈の考えた服が\n完成した。試着できたら連絡がくるはずだけど……）", "zh": "（在服装制作企划中，杏奈设计的服装完成了。等她可以试穿时，应该会联系我，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "c14bfdcc2d641abc81c8c3f6e69d93bf73ac62ae8fb0aa462c68a9aa198f9c39", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お待たせ……。\n思ったより……時間、かかっちゃった……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让你久等了……\n花的时间……比想象中还要久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6a9bb016d81786fdd50ae7e4b4d36fb124aa1beb07e3f4489693720ac1c76b9f", "ja": "ああ、杏奈。これは……！", "zh": "啊，杏奈。这是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "ca88a5f0bca935b04ab5b45ea1dd1555fd7022ffdb896fc38ad8ddac9ba35d32", "ja": "……{$P$}さん？", "zh": "……{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_1004_p", "source_sha256": "245eb3aa6cac4924c58b2b930a0a5f7922c1b214155b6d9b9bc01ea40804a1de", "ja": "デザインは見せてもらってたけど。\nふわっとした感じも可愛くて、よく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "虽然之前给我看过设计图，\n但这种轻盈蓬松的感觉也很可爱，很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "cb0bb9877f38f8da6a789192397e74ef9b0e877ff25a3a4faa0e507b9ad0fd64", "ja": "えへへ……♪\n後ろ……、しっぽも、ついてるんだよ……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪  \n后面……连尾巴也有哦……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "cfbe88ea6eba3dbde3d26745e150b00628fb6ab5eebacee1e3452b4fca3c4387", "ja": "杏奈が、いつか……レベル最大に、なったら……\n着てみたい服……考えて、みました……。", "zh": "杏奈有一天……升到满级以后……想穿的衣服……我想了想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f5ff866d857b116794a5bb5ed17155500f9e739486dc82a7a980a054ae597176", "ja": "レベル最大の杏奈……なるほど。\n杏奈の理想の姿をイメージしてみたってことかな？", "zh": "等级达到最高的杏奈……原来如此。\n也就是说，你试着想象了杏奈理想中的样子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8c59fea4c97f5f9e3512d8bed2ec45203624648834ff98d630edeff8dfb209df", "ja": "確かに……それだけの存在感がある気がするよ。", "zh": "确实……感觉她有那种存在感呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "e51e980af6eb0b2e9eeaa7d9d4029d3330bb51eb4abcc7746ecf0a951ba755b5", "ja": "ん……。いつもの杏奈と、違う感じ……出したかった、\nから……。メガネ、いいなって……思ったの……。", "zh": "嗯……因为杏奈想表现出……和和平时不一样的\n感觉……所以觉得……眼镜，挺不错的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "58e127ef620bf7c8635ff2fcb9d1a5a29b7bf4c28ab160189b2d659efcbaa8bd", "ja": "でも……こういう服、見るのは、いいけど……。\n自分で、着てみると……ちょっと、緊張するね……。", "zh": "但是……看看这种衣服，觉得挺好的……  \n可自己穿上试试……还是会有点紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "64882ca69a830f801b4895291bc8fbe7f2c6529e9abb5be9e9f641800c153dd8", "ja": "杏奈の、好きなもの……いっぱい、入ってるけど……。\nちゃんと、オシャレかなって……考えちゃう……。", "zh": "里面放了好多杏奈喜欢的东西……可是……总会忍不住想，这样真的时髦吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_1012", "source_sha256": "d3a3d7ea51e8defcd01039c41897a01c31084c93e4ec638b155f4220a7fe965d", "ja": "大丈夫！", "zh": "没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_2000_p", "source_sha256": "e71146537aace6945890a7ec96bfb9d4b2c00f9a013c9d031d182455bcd48cd4", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、杏奈。オシャレに見えるし、\nそれに杏奈らしさがたくさん詰まってて、すごくイイ！", "zh": "没事的，杏奈。看起来很时尚，\n而且充满了杏奈的特色，非常棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_2001_024ann", "source_sha256": "9817fe592bd5f3b3a7ef9b5208b7ac35331a23d2161a76ca07673361b04c543e", "ja": "よかった……♪\n杏奈も……この服……お気に入り、です……。", "zh": "太好了……♪\n杏奈也……很喜欢……这套衣服……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_2002_024ann", "source_sha256": "bf85788f6d21b9f89ee47cb6482df01821c096cde874779d72e09a966ed684e1", "ja": "杏奈は、まだまだ、レベル最大じゃないし……\n緊張しちゃうけど……。", "zh": "杏奈还远远没达到最高等级……\n虽然会紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_2003_024ann", "source_sha256": "e19d531e6bdc9276f517c6f60159d29e0033ee1b10fc1353bd676a169191e73d", "ja": "杏奈、こういう服も、好きだよって……。\n色々な人に……知ってもらえたら、いいな……。", "zh": "杏奈想让大家知道……她也喜欢这样的服装……。\n要是能让更多人……了解这一点，就好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_2004_p", "source_sha256": "8d9a7e78d2539eef52dbc508a87a3f13b6d15defe04d5472fa01c0a4cc3052f1", "ja": "そうだな。そのためにも、\n杏奈はいっぱい、その服を着なくちゃな。", "zh": "是啊。为此，杏奈也得多穿穿那件衣服才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_2005_024ann", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_2006_p", "source_sha256": "1def51bb6a71c31bfdffb625048ea52d7a070f36d56d7b49c2034e431c9a3807", "ja": "そうしたら、緊張もしなくなるし、たくさんの人に\n杏奈のお気に入りを知ってもらえるだろう？", "zh": "这样一来，也不会紧张了，还能让更多人知道杏奈喜欢的东西，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_2007_024ann", "source_sha256": "35b368bc24933e260a1c472ffe582e5e768c4b31bd969c1e302b46ea06c30b77", "ja": "……そうだね。\nたくさん着て……レベルを上げる、ってこと……？", "zh": "……嗯。\n就是多穿穿……提升等级，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_2008_p", "source_sha256": "5289c80550324ad9f0b258a0eb920679f48f1e83b8281f60ab1c14f98331ce52", "ja": "ああ。目標は決まってるから、あとは走るだけだ。\n俺も応援するから、一緒に頑張ろう。", "zh": "嗯。目标已经定下来了，接下来只要奋力向前就行。\n我也会为你加油，我们一起努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_2009_024ann", "source_sha256": "7403ac568a5c43ec1ccfe1675ed8e824a2dfbe11125bbdd6ab75beecb01fb833", "ja": "ん……♪　{$P$}さんが\n一緒なら……ちょっと大変でも、がんばります……。", "zh": "嗯……♪　有{$P$}先生\n陪着的话……就算有点辛苦，我也会加油的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_2010_024ann", "source_sha256": "86e6c3d422527935817d545b7e2b1239be9d755db053b7fbd2eba6ff2b868e15", "ja": "この服、みんなに、見てもらうの……\n今から、楽しみ……です……。えへへ……♪", "zh": "这身衣服，能让大家看到……\n我从现在开始，就很期待……呢……嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0564_2011_p", "source_sha256": "0b02b2c0590aed663a5fa1cd078e0b946364e5465846be3f3b192e03daaddfe3", "ja": "（好きなものへの気持ちは、杏奈の原動力になる……。\n理想を現実にするためにも、俺も頑張らなきゃな！）", "zh": "（对喜欢之物的感情，正是杏奈的动力……\n为了让理想成为现实，我也得努力才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
